<title>UK: KfW unit sets 1.5 bln French franc Tec-10 bond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets 1.5 bln French franc Tec-10 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Caisse de Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   BASE	 TEC-10    MATURITY    06.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -140 BP   PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  101.675   FULL FEES   2.00</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    100.00</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS/LUX DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   1.675</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
